==Hunsrik==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|hrx|gmw-cfr|hann}}, from {{inh|hrx|goh|havēn}}, northern variant of {{m|goh|habēn}}, from {{inh|hrx|gem-pro|*habjaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|hrx|/hɔn/}}

===Verb===
{{head|hrx|verb}}

# to [[have]]
#: {{ux|hrx|Ich '''hon''' en groses Haus.|I '''have''' a big house.}}
#: {{ux|hrx|'''Hod'''-der Zeid fer mich se hellfe?|Do you '''have''' time to help me?}}
#: {{ux|hrx|Ich '''had''' en komischer Draum gester Nacht.|I '''had''' a weird dream last night.}}
# {{lb|hrx|auxiliary|with a past participle}} to [[have]] ({{non-gloss definition|forms the [[perfect tense|perfect]]}})
#: {{ux|hrx|Er '''hod''' es gemacht.|He '''has''' done it.}}

